# Atmos Weather App — environment variables
#
# By default the app uses Open-Meteo for forecast data + RainViewer for the
# heat-map tiles. Both are FREE and require NO API KEYS. Everything just works.
#
# ── Optional: use OpenWeatherMap instead ──
# Get a free key at https://openweathermap.org/api (the "One Call API 3.0" tier).
# Uncomment any of the lines below. Each is independent:
#
#   VITE_WEATHER_PROVIDER=openweathermap    # use OWM for forecast data
#   VITE_OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY=your_key   # required if using OWM forecast
#                                          # or for the temperature/clouds/wind/pressure
#                                          # heat-map layers in /map.
#
# Without an OWM key, only the precipitation heat-map (via RainViewer)
# is available on the map page — which is the default.
